  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Quite simply, a tool for instances to see who's joining on who within private lobbies. Kept within the in-game console; This feature would help protect events and private party instances, as well as giving event security knowledge on who's letting who in. \nLordy this would help securing lobbies so much easier when say your having a drinking event, and don't want 12 year olds screaming \"gamer\" words at everyone. This would help identify who's allowing those invites, and give the decision to the host wether to remove or speak to them.",
